omatic login after signing up.\n\nThank you.\nVENTA X\n\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Homepage - https://www.venta-x.com/\n\n\n\n\uc548\ub155\ud558\uc138\uc694!\nVENTA X\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc774\ubc88 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\uc5d0\uc11c \ucd94\uac00\ub418\ub294 \uae30\ub2a5 \ubc0f \ubcc0\uacbd \uc0ac\ud56d\uc740 \uc544\ub798\uc640 \uac19\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n[\uae30\ub2a5 \ucd94\uac00]\n\uc571 \ub0b4 \ud68c\uc6d0\uac00\uc785 \uae30\ub2a5 :\n - \uc571\uc5d0\uc11c \ud68c\uc6d0\uac00\uc785 \ud6c4 \uc790\ub3d9 \ub85c\uadf8\uc778\uc774 \uac00\ub2a5\ud558\ub3c4\ub85d \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8 \ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uac10\uc0ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\nVENTA X\n\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Homepage - https://www.venta-x.com/", "created_date": 1724826661, "id": "8107534519327013", "version": "0.7.287", "version_code": 56, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5370588983021594", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8202665549813909"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1233280367215178"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1719909770, "id": "7785000324913769", "version": "0.7.286", "version_code": 55, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5370588983021594", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "82026655498139